{% comment %}
  SHEmakes — a content page (About, Pressing guide, Pickup & shipping, FAQ).

  Plain Liquid, no island: this is the shop's own rich text, edited in the
  Shopify page editor. There is no state here for React to hold, and wrapping
  prose in a bundle only means it arrives later.

  The body keeps a reading measure — the theme let it run the full width, which
  is why the About page read as a wall.
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  comment
    A sign-up page — "Grab your free sample", "Stay connected" — is a page with
    a Klaviyo form embedded in it, and it wants a different shape from a prose
    page: a band, then the form on a card with the reassurances beside it.
    Detected rather than set by hand, so any future sign-up page gets it too.
  endcomment
  assign has_form = false
  if page.content contains 'klaviyo-form'
    assign has_form = true
  endif

  comment
    The quote page embeds HulkApps' form builder rather than Klaviyo, so it
    fell through to the prose layout and read as a different page from the
    other sign-up ones.
  endcomment
  if page.content contains 'pxFormGenerator' or page.content contains 'formbuilder.hulkapps'
    assign has_form = true
  endif
-%}

{%- if has_form -%}
  <div class="sm-pagehead sm-pagehead--offer">
    <div class="sm-container">
      {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
        <p class="sm-eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      <h1 class="sm-heading sm-heading--lg">{{ page.title }}</h1>

      {%- if section.settings.standfirst != blank -%}
        <p class="sm-pagehead__intro sm-body">{{ section.settings.standfirst }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="sm-section sm-section--tight sm-page--offer">
    <div class="sm-container">
      <div class="sm-offer">
        {%- comment -%}
          The free sample page leads with the sample, not the sign-up: the
          shop asked for the link first and the email form under it. The
          button is found from the page's own link to the product, like the
          form itself is; the stylesheet moves the embedded form to the foot
          of the card.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="sm-offer__card sm-prose rte">
          {%- if page.content contains '/products/free-sample' -%}
            <p class="sm-offer__cta">
              <a class="sm-button sm-button--primary" href="/products/free-sample">
                Get your FREE sample <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
              </a>
            </p>
          {%- endif -%}
          {{ page.content }}
        </div>

        {%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
          <aside class="sm-offer__points">
            {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
              <div class="sm-offer__point" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                <span class="sm-offer__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                  {% render 'sm-icon', name: block.settings.icon %}
                </span>
                <div>
                  <p class="sm-offer__point-title">{{ block.settings.title }}</p>
                  {%- if block.settings.body != blank -%}
                    <p class="sm-offer__point-body">{{ block.settings.body }}</p>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </div>
              </div>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </aside>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
{%- else -%}

<div class="sm-section {% if section.settings.tint %}sm-section--blush{% endif %}">
  <div class="sm-container">
    <header class="sm-page__head">
      {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
        <p class="sm-eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      <h1 class="sm-heading sm-heading--md">{{ page.title }}</h1>

      {%- if section.settings.standfirst != blank -%}
        <p class="sm-body">{{ section.settings.standfirst }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
    </header>

    <div class="sm-prose rte">{{ page.content }}</div>

    {%- if section.settings.cta_label != blank -%}
      <div class="sm-page__actions">
        <a href="{{ section.settings.cta_url | default: routes.all_products_collection_url }}" class="sm-button sm-button--primary">
          {{ section.settings.cta_label }}
        </a>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</div>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "SHEmakes page",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "standfirst", "label": "Intro line", "info": "Shown above the page content." },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "tint", "label": "Blush background", "default": false },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cta_label", "label": "Button" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "cta_url", "label": "Button link" }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "point",
      "name": "Reassurance",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "select",
          "id": "icon",
          "label": "Icon",
          "options": [
            { "value": "mail", "label": "Mail" },
            { "value": "truck", "label": "Delivery" },
            { "value": "leaf", "label": "Maple leaf" },
            { "value": "shield", "label": "Shield" },
            { "value": "star", "label": "Star" },
            { "value": "time", "label": "Clock" }
          ],
          "default": "mail"
        },
        { "type": "text", "id": "title", "label": "Title", "default": "No spam, ever" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "body", "label": "Text" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
